ShareAlike is the point rather than a formality: the reasoning in these
documents can be built on, and what is built on it stays readable to the people
it was built from.

The boundary above is drawn by file extension rather than by category, and that
is deliberate. "Prose" is not a property a reader or a compliance tool can
evaluate, and this directory holds source code beside the documents — so a
category would leave every reader to guess, and different readers would guess
differently.

This file covers only the files described above. Every other file in this
directory, including everything under `src/`, is licensed under the terms in
the LICENSE file at the root of the repository.
